  <p id="c-nanshi-021-subaosheng:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">時有<persName id="c-nanshi-021-subaosheng:p001:m0002" ref="m56_4dl_ukm">蘇寶</persName>者名<persName id="c-nanshi-021-subaosheng:p001:m0006" ref="m56_4dl_ukm">寶生</persName>，本寒門，有文義之美，官至南台侍御史、江甯令，坐知<persName id="c-nanshi-021-subaosheng:p001:m0033" ref="k90_men_xmv">高闍</persName>謀反，不即聞啟，亦伏誅。</p>
